    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to limiting the\nliability of operators and owners of first-response emergency vehicles for\nmonetary penalties for certain traffic violations committed while responding\nto a medical emergency in a city with a population of one million or more\npersons",
